@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Frequently Asked Questions — SAT Jewel";
}

<div class="sat-legal-page-wrap">
    <!-- Header Banner -->
    <div class="sat-legal-banner">
        <div class="sat-legal-banner-inner">
            <span class="sat-legal-badge">Help & Support</span>
            <h1 class="sat-legal-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
            <p class="sat-legal-subtitle">Find answers to common questions about our lab-grown diamonds, moissanite, custom designs, ring sizing, care, and warranties.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sat-legal-container">
        <div class="sat-faq-accordion-wrap">

            <!-- FAQ Item 1 -->
            <div class="sat-faq-item">
                <button class="sat-faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                    <span>Do you take custom design requests?</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-arrow"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="sat-faq-answer">
                    <p>Yes, we do! Customizing jewelry to match your personal vision is our specialty. Whether you already have a specific concept in mind or need assistance in shaping your ideas into a unique piece, the Sat Jewels team is here to assist you every step of the way. You can contact us directly at <a href="mailto:satjewels31@gmail.com">satjewels31@gmail.com</a> or complete our custom order form directly on our site to get started.</p>
                    <p><strong>Please note:</strong> Because bespoke items are custom-crafted specifically for you, they are final sale and non-refundable. However, if your order arrives damaged or defective, we will gladly remake the piece for you.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 2 -->
            <div class="sat-faq-item">
                <button class="sat-faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                    <span>How long does it take to process or make my order?</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-arrow"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="sat-faq-answer">
                    <p>Generally, we require 7 to 8 business days to prepare and craft your order prior to dispatch. Please keep in mind that turnaround times may differ based on the complexity of the piece you select. To ensure complete clarity, estimated delivery schedules are listed right on each product page so you always know what to expect. Should you need precise details about a particular item, feel free to contact the Sat Jewels support team anytime!</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 3 -->
            <div class="sat-faq-item">
                <button class="sat-faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                    <span>What is your return policy?</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-arrow"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="sat-faq-answer">
                    <p>We offer a 30-day return window starting from the day your shipment arrives for all standard in-stock items and ready-made pieces. Please note that custom-designed or personalized jewelry cannot be returned or exchanged, as these creations are made exclusively according to your unique requirements. If you have any questions regarding a return, the Sat Jewels team is always ready to assist you.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 4 -->
            <div class="sat-faq-item">
                <button class="sat-faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                    <span>How can I measure my ring size at home?</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-arrow"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="sat-faq-answer">
                    <p>At Sat Jewels, we adhere to international ring sizing standards. You can conveniently place your order using your local size. If you are uncertain about your measurement, we invite you to check our dedicated 'Find Your Ring Size' guide on the website. It provides easy, step-by-step instructions to help you accurately determine your finger size from home so your new ring fits comfortably.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 5 -->
            <div class="sat-faq-item">
                <button class="sat-faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                    <span>Is it safe to shop online with Sat Jewels?</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-arrow"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="sat-faq-answer">
                    <p>Absolutely. Your privacy and security are our top priorities. We use advanced SSL encryption and trusted payment gateways to ensure that your personal information and payment details are kept 100% secure. You can shop with complete confidence, knowing that your transaction is fully protected every step of the way.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 6 -->
            <div class="sat-faq-item">
                <button class="sat-faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                    <span>Do you provide custom engraving for jewelry?</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-arrow"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="sat-faq-answer">
                    <p>Yes, we provide custom engraving completely free of charge! You can add your personalized message or text in the notes section during checkout. If you miss adding it while placing your order, simply email the Sat Jewels support team with your text before your item ships, and we will happily engrave it for you at no extra cost.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 7 -->
            <div class="sat-faq-item">
                <button class="sat-faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                    <span>What is the best way to contact Sat Jewels?</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-arrow"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="sat-faq-answer">
                    <p>We would love to hear from you! You can stay updated with our newest collections and jewelry inspiration by following our Instagram handle <strong>@@SatJewels</strong>. For order assistance or general inquiries, write to us at <a href="mailto:satjewels31@gmail.com">satjewels31@gmail.com</a> or call us at <strong>+91 76987 27798</strong>. Our customer support team is always ready to help you with anything you need.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 8 -->
            <div class="sat-faq-item">
                <button class="sat-faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                    <span>Do you offer a warranty on your jewelry?</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-arrow"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="sat-faq-answer">
                    <p>Yes, every Sat Jewels piece comes with a 1-year product warranty alongside ongoing, lifetime maintenance support. Please note that this protection applies specifically to crafting and manufacturing defects present at the time of purchase.</p>
                    <p><strong>What is excluded from warranty coverage:</strong></p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Daily wear and tear, cosmetic scratching, or natural metal tarnishing over time.</li>
                        <li>Metal discoloration caused by exposure to lotions, cosmetics, pools, harsh chemicals, or bathing.</li>
                        <li>Prong deterioration from routine wear that leads to stone displacement.</li>
                        <li>Accidental loss or theft of gemstones or the entire jewelry piece.</li>
                        <li>Damage resulting from neglected repairs needed to maintain structural stability.</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>For long-term care and everyday protection against accidental damage, we recommend routine servicing to keep your fine jewelry looking its best.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 9 -->
            <div class="sat-faq-item">
                <button class="sat-faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                    <span>Is your jewelry crafted from solid precious metals or plated?</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-arrow"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="sat-faq-answer">
                    <p>Every creation at Sat Jewels is made strictly from 100% solid fine metals. Whether you select Sterling Silver, 10K, 14K, 18K Gold, or Platinum, we never use metal plating or base metal coatings. To guarantee authenticity and long-term value, each item is laser-hallmarked with its metal purity stamp, ensuring you receive a genuine, heirloom-quality piece built to last.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 10 -->
            <div class="sat-faq-item">
                <button class="sat-faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                    <span>What is a lab-grown diamond?</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-arrow"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="sat-faq-answer">
                    <p>Lab-grown diamonds—frequently referred to as lab-created, synthetic, or eco-conscious diamonds—are real diamonds developed inside high-tech laboratory environments. Starting from a natural diamond seed, advanced technology recreates the extreme pressure and heat conditions of the Earth's mantle to grow a genuine diamond. These stones possess the exact same physical, chemical, and optical properties as mined diamonds. At Sat Jewels, we prioritize sustainability and ethics; our lab diamonds are entirely mine-free, ensuring an environmentally safe, conflict-free, and socially responsible choice for your fine jewelry.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 11 -->
            <div class="sat-faq-item">
                <button class="sat-faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                    <span>Do you carry lab-grown diamonds in your collection?</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-arrow"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="sat-faq-answer">
                    <p>Absolutely! Sat Jewels offers a wide selection of lab-grown diamonds and fine jewelry featuring them. Our inventory includes both CVD and HPHT lab-created diamonds. To ensure absolute transparency and top-tier quality, our diamonds are certified by leading global gemological laboratories, including IGI and GIA. You can shop with total peace of mind knowing your gemstone is independently graded and authentic.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 12 -->
            <div class="sat-faq-item">
                <button class="sat-faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                    <span>Do lab-grown diamonds test as real diamonds or moissanite on standard testers?</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-arrow"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="sat-faq-answer">
                    <p>Yes, lab-created diamonds share identical chemical makeup and physical traits with mined diamonds. However, how they react on basic hand-held testers can vary by creation method:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>CVD Lab Diamonds:</strong> These will register as genuine diamonds on standard handheld thermal detectors because their thermal conductivity is identical to natural diamonds.</li>
                        <li><strong>HPHT Lab Diamonds:</strong> Due to minor trace elements, basic or older testing tools may sometimes misidentify HPHT stones as moissanite.</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>For precise, foolproof authentication, the Sat Jewels team relies on professional gemological institutes like IGI and GIA. These world-renowned laboratories utilize advanced scientific instruments to accurately identify and certify whether a gemstone is natural, CVD, or HPHT.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 13 -->
            <div class="sat-faq-item">
                <button class="sat-faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                    <span>Are lab-grown diamonds authentic real diamonds?</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-arrow"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="sat-faq-answer">
                    <p>Absolutely. Lab-grown diamonds are 100% genuine diamonds in every way. They feature the exact same chemical composition, optical brilliance, hardness, and dazzling sparkle as mined diamonds. Because they are grown using cutting-edge technology that replicates the Earth's natural creation process, it is impossible to distinguish them from mined diamonds with the naked eye. Only specialized gemological labs like IGI, GIA, or SGL can differentiate them using advanced laboratory equipment. At Sat Jewels, we guarantee that all our lab diamonds deliver the true beauty and permanence of a natural gemstone.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 14 -->
            <div class="sat-faq-item">
                <button class="sat-faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                    <span>Are Sat Jewels lab-grown diamonds certified?</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-arrow"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="sat-faq-answer">
                    <p>Yes, absolutely! At Sat Jewels, quality and authenticity are our top priorities. Every eligible lab-grown diamond in our collection comes with an independent grading certificate from leading global gemological authorities such as IGI (International Gemological Institute) or GIA (Gemological Institute of America). These certificates verify key details, including the diamond's cut, color, clarity, carat weight, and origin, ensuring you purchase with total confidence.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 15 -->
            <div class="sat-faq-item">
                <button class="sat-faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                    <span>Do you offer moissanite jewelry?</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-arrow"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="sat-faq-answer">
                    <p>Yes, we certainly do! Sat Jewels features a premium range of moissanite stones and moissanite-embellished jewelry. Renowned for its exceptional brilliance, durability, and cost-effectiveness, moissanite offers a stunning, sustainable choice for any piece. Every moissanite item we provide is carefully handpicked to deliver top-tier optical quality, fire, and long-lasting sparkle.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 16 -->
            <div class="sat-faq-item">
                <button class="sat-faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                    <span>How can I properly maintain and care for my jewelry?</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-arrow"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="sat-faq-answer">
                    <p>To keep your Sat Jewels pieces looking flawless and vibrant, we recommend following these simple care practices:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Everyday Habits:</strong> Always take off your jewelry before engaging in high-impact exercises, swimming, bathing, or sleeping. Additionally, apply cosmetics, hair products, perfumes, and skin lotions prior to putting on your jewelry to prevent harsh chemical exposure.</li>
                        <li><strong>Cleaning Instructions:</strong> Prepare a solution of lukewarm water mixed with a few drops of mild soap. Soak your jewelry briefly, then use an ultra-soft bristle brush to gently clean around setting edges and gemstone facets. Rinse thoroughly with clean warm water to remove all residue, and dry gently using a microfiber polishing cloth. Never use paper towels or facial tissues, as their tiny fibers can cause micro-scratches on metals.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 17 -->
            <div class="sat-faq-item">
                <button class="sat-faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                    <span>Do you design jewelry for men?</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-arrow"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="sat-faq-answer">
                    <p>Yes, absolutely! At Sat Jewels, we offer a dedicated collection of men's fine jewelry, including stylish rings, wedding bands, pendants, and custom-designed pieces. Whether you prefer a classic, bold, or contemporary look, our craftsmen can create refined designs tailored specifically for men.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 18 -->
            <div class="sat-faq-item">
                <button class="sat-faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                    <span>Do you offer wholesale or B2B opportunities?</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-arrow"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="sat-faq-answer">
                    <p>Yes, we warmly welcome wholesale partnerships and business-to-business collaborations! Sat Jewels provides competitive bulk pricing and tailored solutions for retailers, jewelry stores, and independent sellers. To discuss wholesale rates or custom bulk inquiries, feel free to reach out directly to our team via WhatsApp or phone at <strong>+91 76987 27798</strong>.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<script>
    function toggleFaq(btn) {
        const item = btn.parentElement;
        const isOpen = item.classList.contains('active');
        document.querySelectorAll('.sat-faq-item').forEach(i => i.classList.remove('active'));
        if (!isOpen) {
            item.classList.add('active');
        }
    }
</script>

<style>
    .sat-legal-page-wrap {
        background: #000000;
        color: #ffffff;
        min-height: 100vh;
        padding-bottom: 80px;
        font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    }
    .sat-legal-banner {
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(212, 178, 112, 0.15) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 100%);
        padding: 80px 24px 40px;
        text-align: center;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212, 178, 112, 0.2);
    }
    .sat-legal-banner-inner {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .sat-legal-badge {
        display: inline-block;
        background: rgba(212, 178, 112, 0.15);
        color: #D4B270;
        padding: 6px 18px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(212, 178, 112, 0.3);
    }
    .sat-legal-title {
        font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        font-size: 3rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #ffffff;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .sat-legal-subtitle {
        color: #cccccc;
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .sat-legal-container {
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 40px auto 0;
        padding: 0 24px;
    }
    .sat-faq-accordion-wrap {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 16px;
    }
    .sat-faq-item {
        background: #0d0d0d;
        border: 1px solid rgba(212, 178, 112, 0.2);
        border-radius: 10px;
        overflow: hidden;
        transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
    }
    .sat-faq-item.active {
        border-color: #D4B270;
    }
    .sat-faq-question {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 22px 28px;
        background: transparent;
        border: none;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-align: left;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: color 0.3s ease;
    }
    .sat-faq-question:hover {
        color: #D4B270;
    }
    .faq-arrow {
        color: #D4B270;
        transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    }
    .sat-faq-item.active .faq-arrow {
        transform: rotate(180deg);
    }
    .sat-faq-answer {
        display: none;
        padding: 0 28px 24px;
        color: #d1d5db;
        line-height: 1.75;
        font-size: 1rem;
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
        margin-top: 4px;

    }
    .sat-faq-item.active .sat-faq-answer {
        display: block;
        padding-top: 20px;
    }
    .sat-faq-answer p {
        margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .sat-faq-answer p:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .sat-faq-answer ul {
        margin: 12px 0 16px 20px;
    }
    .sat-faq-answer li {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .sat-faq-answer a {
        color: #D4B270;
        text-decoration: underline;
    }
</style>
